<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>freak for you</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Haiden Henderson</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">freak for you</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2TvnYVAd1HeCA2ZA56Ykbl</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.010" end="00:07.680">Hey babe, you gotta keep it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.680" end="00:10.250">You know your walls are thin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.250" end="00:12.740">Here, put my finger in your mouth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.740" end="00:15.330">So we can go again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.330" end="00:17.370">Your neighbor knew my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.370" end="00:20.500">Before I ever shook his hand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.500" end="00:24.270">I know him from the way he knocks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.270" end="00:26.890">I'll wake you up, don't need a clock</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.890" end="00:29.490">You like to start your day on top</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.490" end="00:32.040">You like it rough, I'll play along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.040" end="00:35.650">I love that you know what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.650" end="00:37.150">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.950" end="00:38.450">Get on top</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.240" end="00:40.650">Acting tough, don't let me talk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.650" end="00:42.150">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.740" end="00:43.740">Show me who's boss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.740" end="00:45.990">I'll be a freak for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.990" end="00:47.490">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.230" end="00:48.730">Guide my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.580" end="00:51.140">Leave a hickey on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.140" end="00:52.640">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.070" end="00:54.020">Tell me what's next</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.020" end="01:02.020">I'll be a freak for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.950" end="01:09.890">You sing a melody so sticky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.890" end="01:12.060">It's stuck in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.060" end="01:13.750">You hit the high note</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.750" end="01:17.220">When I show you how to use your legs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.220" end="01:21.150">I listen to it when I touch myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.150" end="01:23.670">I'll wake you up, don't need a clock</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.670" end="01:26.260">You like to start your day on top</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.260" end="01:28.840">You like it rough, I'll play along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.840" end="01:32.360">I love that you know what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.360" end="01:33.860">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.690" end="01:35.190">Get on top</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.030" end="01:37.460">Acting tough, don't let me talk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.460" end="01:38.960">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.470" end="01:40.440">Show me who's boss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.440" end="01:42.750">I'll be a freak for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.750" end="01:44.250">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.970" end="01:45.470">Guide my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.340" end="01:47.910">Leave a hickey on my neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.910" end="01:49.410">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.830" end="01:50.780">Tell me what's next</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.780" end="01:55.990">I'll be a freak for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.990" end="02:01.080">Whatever you want me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.080" end="02:06.260">I'll be a freak for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.260" end="02:11.420">Whatever you want me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.420" end="02:13.690">I'll be a freak for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.690" end="02:15.190">Nah, nah, nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.950" end="02:16.450">Nah, nah, nah, nah, nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.310" end="02:17.810">Nah, nah, nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.580" end="02:19.080">Nah, nah, nah, nah, nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.900" end="02:20.400">Nah, nah, nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.120" end="02:21.690">Nah, nah, nah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.690" end="02:24.540">I'll be a freak for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.540" end="02:28.540" /></div></body></tt>